  "text": "I started having tremors in my lips.\nTingling in my hands and muscle cramps.\nIt also caused me to have anxiety attacks which I never had prior to taking this med.\nit caused me to land in the emergency room when I experienced a muscle spasm in my lips!\nVery scary!\nI thought I was having a stroke!\nThank God\nI wasn't!\nAlso noticed my heart rate is up because of this med.\nI would not recommend this med to anyone.\nEspecially if you are like me and have a sensitive system to meds .\n",
